# There was none, so `COPY` sent the whole working tree -- .git included -- to the builder
# on every build. These are the entries that are never right to ship and never right to
# upload. Note what is deliberately NOT here: **/*.md. vibey-skills' 644 SKILL.md are
# product data that its wheel force-includes, and excluding them would build a wheel that
# fails its own "carries every skill" contract.
.git
**/.venv
**/site
**/htmlcov
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
